# These folders contain:
#   - Backend Apps Script code (.gs files with Spreadsheet ID, admin emails,
#     business logic — security risk if exposed)
#   - Internal docs (project handoff, API spec, WhatsApp templates with
#     driver personal info — PDPA risk if exposed)
#   - Legacy/historical files (Excel sheets, V1 deployment guide)
#
# Both you and cowork should sync these via OneDrive / company drive,
# NOT via GitHub. GitHub only hosts the public front-end HTML.

backend/
docs/
legacy/

